# Omni Terminology

Omni's vocabulary and concepts are defined in context across the skills — this rule is a Cursor pointer (Claude Code loads the skills directly):

- **Model structure** — model / topic / view / dimension / measure / relationship → **`omni-model-explorer`**
- **Model layers, branches, query views, write modes** → **`omni-model-builder`**
- **Content concepts** — workbook / dashboard / draft / folder / label → **`omni-content-explorer`** and **`omni-content-builder`**
- **Blobby (the Omni Agent), AI context, user attributes** → **`omni-ai-optimizer`** and **`omni-admin`**
